## 6. Remaining blockers and claim limits

Before source dispatch: independent critique of this revised exact plan; Sol integration of accepted PR14 and G0 closure verification; qualification of the selected service/auth/container/client runtime by integration Sol. Before foundation acceptance: actual transactional/auth/browser/process denial results. Before generator acceptance: full required calibration and comparator pilots, mandatory conditional approximation checks, truth/analytic/fault/distribution/scheduling/cell/preset evidence; unavailable compute, unresolved mandatory conditional integration or unachieved precision blocks the affected G1 task with targets/artifacts retained. Later-engine-dependent inference is separately pending, never simulated as completed G1 evidence.

